+Show Configuration
+-----------------
+
+To see the entire configuration loaded for your application, you can
+print it as JSON with the :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command. ::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "ENV": "production",
+      ...
+    }
+
+Values for keys containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN``, or
+``KEY`` are masked as ``***`` so they never appear in the output.
+
+
